WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:06.089
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, I hope you all
enjoyed the season 4 premiere.

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:09.600
We’ve all been waiting so long, Peter Dinklage
probably could have just read the phone book

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.790
for 54 minutes and we’d have been happy.

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.450
So here’s what I’m going to do.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:19.470
This video will be a review of the episode
with top 5 moments and my first round of the

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:20.470
weekly giveaway.

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:23.829
All you have to do to participate is be a
subscriber and leave a comment.

00:00:23.829 --> 00:00:29.939
I also explain a little more in detail in
my season 3 video I posted earlier today,

00:00:29.939 --> 00:00:33.610
so I’ll add a link to that at the end.

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:36.780
Also, please don’t post any pirate links
in the comments.

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:39.610
I’d like to be able to work with HBO in
the future.

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:40.930
They do not take kindly to pirates.

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:41.930
So let’s get started.

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:43.510
Here are my top 5 moments from the episode.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:46.080
Careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
it yet.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.870
Number 5 - The Melting Down of Ice

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:52.510
Notice I didn’t say the forging of Oathkeeper
and Widow’s Wail.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:56.980
This was all about calling back to Ned Stark
and all the Starks who have fallen.

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:59.850
The shot started on the sheath, which was
made of a wolf’s pelt.

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:02.870
It was actually a pretty heartbreaking way
to start a new season.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:07.440
The music was even really sad with Tywin and
his haunting gaze.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:10.690
I was actually kind of proud of Jaime for
defying him in the scene that followed.

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:13.230
And that he tried to give oathkeeper back.

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:17.760
The show does this amazing job at using visual
cues to call back to earlier moments.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:22.040
George RR Martin writes a lot of them in the
story himself.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:27.350
But it’s up to the show to interpret those
visually and the whole forge scene was amazing.

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:31.640
If you want to read this chapter in book 3
it’s 32.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:36.650
If you want to know more about the blades,
like Tywin said, only three people know how

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:40.979
to work Valyrian steel and Tobho Mott, their
smith, is the best.

00:01:40.979 --> 00:01:44.990
Ice was Ned Stark’s blade and when it was
reforged into the two smaller ones Tobho added

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:51.070
a reddish black hue to it for lannister colors.

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:57.750
Number 4 - Oberyn Martell’s Whore House
introduction

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.840
It wouldn’t be Game Of Thrones if there
weren’t a scene in a whore house.

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:03.380
Take off your clothes, we’ll be here awhile.

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:07.320
I just loved the way Tyrion shook his head
when Oberyn invited him to his little sex

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:08.320
party.

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:09.320
Remember the way he described him.

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:10.320
He’s fucked half of Westeros.

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:12.650
The culture in Dorne is a little different
too.

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:16.990
Women have more social standing and being
bisexual like Oberyn isn’t as big a deal

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:19.980
as it is in King’s Landing.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:24.990
As funny as the Tyrion introduction was, their
conversation about his secret mission to kill

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:29.120
the mountain is really what’s going to drive
his character forward this season.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:33.230
Notice he dropped some epic knowledge on us
about Lyanna Stark too.

00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:38.400
Remember he said, Rhaegar left Elia for another
woman and it started a war.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.560
That was Ned Stark’s sister.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:45.260
A lot of people, myself included think that
Rhaeger and Lyanna are Jon Snow’s real parents.

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:48.200
And Ned just hid it from everyone to protect
him.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:54.220
Thus making a song of ice and fire about a
Son of Ice and Fire.

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:56.620
Just a theory, but one of the best I’ve
seen.

00:02:56.620 --> 00:03:00.330
If you want to read the first Oberyn book
chapter in Storm of Swords it’s Chapter

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.330
38.

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:03.300
Number 3 - Jaime Gets his Golden Hand

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:06.910
It was so funny how Jaime just waved goodbye
awkwardly with it.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:13.319
The hand itself is so iconic just like Oathkeeper
or Needle but in reality it’s just as useless

00:03:13.319 --> 00:03:14.319
as he claims it is.

00:03:14.319 --> 00:03:16.660
A hook would be more practical.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:20.030
It seems like they’re combining a lot of
Jaime’s later chapters from book 3 with

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:22.340
what’s happening right now.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:28.370
It’s implied that Cersei isn’t down for
twincest anymore just because she’s so fried

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:30.630
from everything that happened since Season
2.

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:34.430
But there is on really notable scene from
Chapter 62.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:37.780
Something tells me that they’ll just go
for it.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.480
It’s something to look forward to.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:40.950
Number 2 - Daenerys and her Kitty Cats

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:46.970
It’s the shot from the trailer as cute as
it is to see her purring in her lap it’s

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:50.870
all about them being untameable.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:55.470
The computer graphics has also evolved a lot
in the last year.

00:03:55.470 --> 00:04:00.659
Drogon is like one of those big dogs that
thinks it’s a little lap dog.

00:04:00.659 --> 00:04:07.620
He even snapped at her like a hungry dog would
when she tried to slow his feeding.

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:10.340
Imagine what’s going to happen in another
year.

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:14.459
Dragons that aren’t kept in captivity will
just keep growing.

00:04:14.459 --> 00:04:21.350
It was the first episode, so I didn’t expect
them to blow their whole CG Dragon budget.

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:25.260
I’m really looking forward to seeing a few
Drogon action scenes like they’ve teased

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:27.449
in the trailer

00:04:27.449 --> 00:04:32.420
That look on Ser Jorah’s face as he’s
staring at Drogon tells you everything you

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:33.510
need to know.

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.860
This will not end well for anyone.

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:41.650
In a battle between nature vs nurture, nature
will always win.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:46.530
If you want to read this part in the books
it’s book 3 chapter 57.

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:50.169
And my Number 1 moment - Arya Takes Back Needle

00:04:50.169 --> 00:04:53.400
With the way they rode out of there, you’d
think the whole world is on fire.

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:57.710
It’s like Arya is becoming a demon and she’s
descending into hell.

00:04:57.710 --> 00:04:59.030
Smiling no less.

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:04.040
Did you see how much she smiled as she slowly
slipped Needle into Polliver’s head.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:05.900
She killed the other two Lannister men that
way.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:10.170
Not with a giant hack, she just very gently
massaged the blades into them.

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:11.470
Sh, sh, sh, that’s right.

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:12.970
Just be quiet and die.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:16.690
Best line of the episode was her whispering
“Fine Little Blade, Maybe I’ll Pick My

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:17.690
Teeth With It”.

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:21.940
There was a really notable change from the
books here, in Storm of Swords, at the crossroads

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:27.430
when she got needle back, the Hound was mortally
wounded and she left him for dead.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:31.240
So since they’re still riding together in
good health we’ll have to see if they split

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:32.550
them up anytime soon.

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:36.790
But personally I don’t mind, they’re so
much fun together.

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:40.210
Don’t you just feel like it’s Arya leading
him around giving orders.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:41.540
Not the other way around.

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:42.820
‘
If you want to read that crossroads scene

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:46.430
in the books it’s book 3 chapter 74.

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:55.740
See how things are jumping around a lot in
the book from scene to scene.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:06:00.510
As a bonus WTF moment we have to talk about
the Thenn’s.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:05.170
I thought that Joseph Gatt was playing the
Magnar of Thenn, but it looks like they cast

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:08.080
someone else in that role.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:11.780
Who else said that Seven line in their head
when they threw the bag down at the fire.

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.919
“What’s in the bag, what’s in the bag!”

00:06:13.919 --> 00:06:18.430
After that all I could think about was ye
old Hannibal Lecter’s cooking blog.

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:22.479
I can’t remember, but up to this point in
the story I don’t think we’ve seen actual

00:06:22.479 --> 00:06:24.389
cannibalism occur on the show.

00:06:24.389 --> 00:06:25.389
Unless you count the wights.

00:06:25.389 --> 00:06:27.680
And they don’t eat people, they just chop
them up.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:28.890
But now it’s your turn.

00:06:28.890 --> 00:06:31.610
Let me know what your favorite moment was
from the premiere.

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:33.169
Oberyn in the whore house?

00:06:33.169 --> 00:06:38.201
Daenerys and the Dragons or did you just think
them including the Ser Dontos Sansa scene

00:06:38.201 --> 00:06:43.139
was really cool.

00:06:43.139 --> 00:06:46.560
There really are too many awesome things to
talk about in just one video.

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:50.070
So feel free to add stuff in the comments.

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:52.449
Overall I rated the episode as an A minus.

00:06:52.449 --> 00:06:57.229
I have to save the coveted A for the biggest
and best episodes.

00:06:57.229 --> 00:07:01.520
But as first episodes go, I loved this way
better than season 3 episode 1.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:05.130
The humor was great, just a lot of really
subtle additions from the actors.

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:10.009
Like Tyrion just shaking his head and Nikolaj
Coster-Waldau shaking his golden hand goodbye.

00:07:10.009 --> 00:07:14.050
One of the biggest reasons the show is so
good is because the actors are so good.

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:17.370
I’ll say my favorite character from the
episode was definitely Oberyn.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.009
He’s going to be so much fun.

00:07:19.009 --> 00:07:23.050
He’s like a wild rockstar on vacation and
King’s Landing is the hotel that he’s

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:24.350
going to trash.

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:29.170
And that line, Tell you father the Lannisters
aren’t the only ones who pay their debts.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:30.170
So good.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:33.660
I could talk about this all day, but let me
know what your final thoughts are on the episode,

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:36.270
was there anything you didn’t like.

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:40.280
Like I said, I’ll be announcing the winner
of this week’s giveaway in my Q&amp;A tomorrow.

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:41.690
You can click here to get that video.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.920
I’ll add the annotation as soon as I post
the video.

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:46.389
And you can click here for all my other season
4 videos.

00:07:46.389 --> 00:07:47.550
Thanks so much for watching, I can’t wait
for next week.

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.509
This season is going to be amazing.

00:07:49.509 --> 00:07:50.910
High Fives everybody!

